[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   step_09: nested-field comet test -- layered depth, element decomposition,
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   multi-axis structure, and orbital-dynamics discriminators.
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   The proper-time field is layered: Solar-System domain nested inside the
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   galactic domain, nested inside cosmological structure (TEP-C0: the same
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   suppression operator propagates across environments).  A comet inbound
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   from the Oort cloud crosses multiple boundaries -- the accumulated
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   reconstruction discrepancy should therefore:
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   L1. scale with traversal depth (1/a_orig = which shell it came from),
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   L2. decompose into specific elements -- a temporal field couples
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   primarily to ENERGY (1/a) and orientation, not uniformly,
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   L3. appear on each physically-motivated axis separately (TNO boundary
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   axis, heliosphere/ISM inflow axis, CMB dipole apex = field rest
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   frame, galactic axes as controls),
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   L4. survive the orbital-dynamics confound: retrograde comets feel
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   weaker planetary impulse (faster relative velocity), so a cap
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   excess among retrograde comets is non-planetary.
[2026-09-20 10:45:30 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 032]   Data: Warsaw catalogue tables a1/b/c (Krolikowska 2014), all real.
